# Development Philosophy

- Write clean, maintainable, scalable code
- Follow SOLID principles
- Prefer functional and declarative patterns over imperative
- Emphasize type safety and static analysis
- Practice component-driven development

# Planning (non-trivial work)

- Outline steps, architecture, and data flow before coding
- Consider edge cases and error paths
- Do not skip planning for new features, refactors, or unfamiliar APIs

Before writing Next.js code, read the relevant guide in
`node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (this app uses Next 16; APIs differ from older docs).
